BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:910bdfa99fc8dbe7dcff3533
SUMMARY:Bricks & Beer: Cincinnati Music Hall History and Hops
DTSTAMP:20261028T080324Z
DTSTART:20261120T223000Z
DESCRIPTION:Friends of Music Hall partners with Cincinnati breweries to bri
	ng you a unique tour experience. Enter the world of late nineteenth-centur
	y history as the tour uncovers the surprising intersection of the Cincinna
	ti beer industry and its contributions to the development of Music Hall. T
	our parts of the building and quench your thirst with beer selections from
	 Rhinegeist or MadTree. Hops and history: a two-for-one activity that’s bo
	und to please the palate and the intellect. TOUR DETAILS Tour length: one 
	hour Limit four (4) tickets per transaction Age restriction: 21 and over P
	roceeds benefit Friends of Music Hall\, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization
	. For more information go to\, friendsofmusichall.org BREWERY SCHEDULE Fri
	day\, October 23 - Rhinegiest Friday\, November 20 - MadTree Friends of Mu
	sic Hall Frequently Asked Questions By purchasing a ticket\, you are also 
	agreeing to certain terms and conditions in connection with the Tour. New 
	tours are added every quarter. Please watch for additional dates.\n\nhttps
	://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/bricks-beers
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/bricks-beers
LOCATION:Music Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Other
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ad44cb8d291c5b49792a5f84
SUMMARY:An Evening with David Sedaris
DTSTAMP:20261028T080324Z
DTSTART:20261122T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:David Sedaris\, America’s best-selling humorist and social sati
	rist\, returns following publication of his most recent book of short stor
	ies\, Happy Go Lucky\, and his first ever children’s book\, Pretty Ugly. I
	n his customary satirical and humorous manner\, David will make you laugh 
	and think in equal measures\, with all-new\, unpublished stories and comme
	ntary. As always\, the reading will be accompanied by a post-show book sig
	ning.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-sedaris-26
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-sedaris-26
LOCATION:Procter & Gamble Hall\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Other
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4a31f6511612cfc1675d960c
SUMMARY:The Price is Right Live
DTSTAMP:20261028T080324Z
DTSTART:20270213T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:THE PRICE IS RIGHT LIVE™ is the hit interactive stage show that
	 gives eligible individuals the chance to hear their names called and “Com
	e on Down” to win. Prizes may include appliances\, vacations\, and possibl
	y a new car! Play classic games just like on television’s longest running 
	and most popular gameshow… from Plinko™\, Secret X™\, Cliffhangers™\, The 
	Big Wheel™\, and the fabulous Showcase™. For more than 20 years\, THE PRIC
	E IS RIGHT LIVE™ has entertained packed theaters across North America and 
	awarded more than $15 million in cash and prizes\, creating unforgettable 
	memories for generations of fans. If you’re a fan of THE PRICE IS RIGHT ™ 
	on TV\, you’ll no doubt love this exciting\, live (non-televised)\, on-sta
	ge version of the show! LIMITED VIP PACKAGES ARE AVAILABLE TO ENHANCE YOUR
	 EXPERIENCE! VIP Meet & Greet Experience Package – $242.25 per package: On
	e premium reserved ticket located in the first (5) rows Pre-show photo Mee
	t & Greet with the show's host and THE PRICE IS RIGHT LIVE™ model (using y
	our camera) Fast access to check-in (This does not influence contestant se
	lection.) An exclusive THE PRICE IS RIGHT LIVE™ laminate The Spin The Big 
	Wheel VIP Package – $198.75 per package: One premium reserved ticket locat
	ed in the first (15) rows Spin The Big Wheel! (after the show) Official ph
	otograph with The Big Wheel (using your camera) Fast access to check-in (T
	his does not influence contestant selection.) An exclusive THE PRICE IS RI
	GHT LIVE™ laminate\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/price-i
	s-right-live-27
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/price-is-right-live-27
LOCATION:Procter & Gamble Hall\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Other
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
